# The official SparkDEX values below are intentionally disabled on Coston2
# until their route has bytecode and liquidity. Set the generic USDT0_ROUTE_*
# fields only for a verified route. ADR 0007 permits PAYMORPH_TESTNET for the
# separately labelled, testnet-only real-token route.
